=== Multi-dimensional Risk Rating Model ===
Risk Model Dimensions:
1. Margin Volatility - top 25% flagged as high volatility
2. Payment Behavior - Poor (4), Average (3), Good (2), Excellent (1)
3. RFM Segment - At Risk (4), Need Attention (3), others (1-2)
4. Revenue Trend Correlation - negative correlation indicates declining revenue
5. Business Stability Score - lower scores indicate higher risk
6. Collection/Outstanding Ratio - higher outstanding = higher risk

